{title: Hum Aapki Aankhon Mein}
{artist: Pyaasa Mohammed Rafi Geeta Dutt S D Burman}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Hum Aapaki Aan [D]khon Mein,        Is [C]Dil Ko Basaa [G]De To
[G]Hum Mund Ke Palako [D]Ko,        Is [C]Dil Ko Sazaa [G]De To
[G]Hum Aapaki Aan [D]khon Mein,        Is [C]Dil Ko Basaa [G]De To
In [D]Zulfo Me Gundhe [A]ge,        [A]Ham Phul Muhabbat Ke
[G]Zulfo Ko Jhatak Kar [D]Ham,        Ye [C]Phul Giraa [G]De To
[G]Hum Aapaki Aan [D]khon Mein,        Is [C]Dil Ko Basaa [G]De To
Hum [D]Aapako Khvaabo [A]Mein,        [A]Laa Laa Ke Sataa [D]yege
Hum [G]Aapaki Aankhon [D]Se,        [C]Nide Hi Udaa [G]de To
[G]Hum Aapaki Aan [D]khon Mein,        Is [C]Dil Ko Basaa [G]De To
Hum [D]Aapake Kadamo [A]Para,        [A]Gir Jaayege Gash [D]Khaa Kar
Is [G]Par Bhi Na Ham [D]Apane,        [C]Aachal Ki Havaa [G]De To
[G]Hum Aapaki Aan [D]khon Mein,        Is [C]Dil Ko Basaa [G]De To
